Zero point energy                ...      0.22407979 Eh     140.61 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00892129 Eh       5.60 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
